pin","Scott Christopher","Arnold Vosloo","Mykelti Williamson","Cliff Simon","Musetta Vander","Sean Cameron Michael","Skyler Seymour","Garikayi Mutambirwa","Mike Falkow","Ambyr Childers","Victor Rivers","Matias Ponce","Tony Plana","Juan Javier Cardenas","Christopher Goodman","Oliver Rayon","Ron Melendez","Yvans Jourdain","Steve Kazee","Afemo Omilami","Erica Piccininni","Adetokumboh M'Cormack","Paul Sorvino","Aida Turturro","Vincent Spano","Raymond Cham Jr.","Nadia Lanfranconi","Hector Luis Bustamante","Sandra Echeverría","Daniel Faraldo","Juliocesar Chavez","Joshua Snyder","James Kyson","Eddie Shin","Taylor Black","Briana White","Simon Kassianides","Richard Speight Jr.","Erin Karpluk","Bernhard Forcher","Tzi Ma","Toni Trucks","Osric Chau","Gwendoline Yeo","Hank Chen","Arturo del Puerto","Luis Moncada","Rebeka Montoya","Esai Morales","Sophia Santi","Sofia Milos","Anthony Skordi","Mike Dopud","Danielle Argyros","Jim Beaver","Julian Acosta","Jaimi Paige","Paget Brewster","Russell Wong","Elizabeth Sung","Sheena Chou","Diane Yang","Peter Macon","Hawthorne James","Katie Amess","Bernard White","Charisma Carpenter","Shalin Agarwal","William Forsythe","Jeremy Ratchford","Anya Monzikova","Kathy Christopherson","Peter Banifaz","Zuhair Haddad","John Romano"],"screenwriters":["Adam Glass","Christopher Barbour","Matthew Lau","Daniele Nathanson","Erica Messer","Erica Meredith","Ticona S. Joy"],"cinematographers":["Yasu Tanida","Rodney Charters"],"composers":["Marc Fantini","Steffan Fantini","Scott Gordon"],"reviews":[{"author":"bundaboy","text":"Gary Sinise tady hraje naprosto stejnou postavu, jakou hrál v CSI:NY, takže to spíš působí, jako spinoff CSI = Maca Taylora už nebavilo rešit vraždy v New Yorku a tak vezme práci, kde může řešit případy po celém světě... :) K tomu má jedno velké letadlo a celkem sympatický tým.1. série = 65%(19.11.2016)","stars":3},{"author":"shifter","text":"Slabucky spin-off serialu Criminal Minds, co je trosku nepochopitelne kedze uz aj povodny serial nejaky ten rok straca dych (a toci hercov). Tu je v hlavnej ulohe Gary Sinise, ktory je zaroven jednym z producentov serialu. Ano, v kazdej epizode sa team vysetrovatelov presuva do inej krajiny, paradoxne vsak len v podobe ilustracnych zaberov, kedze serial sa nakruca v Kalifornii. Zapletky su plne klise a za vlasy pritiahnutych stereotypov, vratane naivnych a dovercivych turistov na jednej strane a zakernych \"miestnych\", ktori sa nezastavia pred nicim a v reale ich moze zastavit len gulka z hlavne agenta FBI. Miestna policia je spravidla vykreslovana ako banda kratkozrakych, neschopnych amaterov...(04.06.2016)","stars":2},{"author":"Mamlas","text":"Bylo by to koukatelné, ale na tu hnusnou blbou tuleňku se bohužel dívat nedá., tady nedoukáno, vypnuto.(11.04.2017)","stars":null}],"vods":[{"platform":"Disney+","url":"https://srv.tunefindforfans.com/showads/track/srvclk.php?aid=100006796&lp=https%3A//www.disneyplus.com/en-cz/browse/entity-94549c74-f9b2-4679-bf3d-1250076d76b5"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/424197-myslenky-zlocince-za-hranicemi/prehled/","root_id":424197,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":2,"episode_count":26,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[]}